---
name: medical-bill-audit-report
description: >-
  Use when producing a medical bill audit report: rebuilds the colorful
  dark-mode HTML report and the printable light-theme PDF from an audit JSON,
  with red/amber/purple/blue/green flags.
---
# Audit report (HTML + PDF)
Rebuild the report from this skill alone. If `~/med-bill-auditor/render.py` and `report_template.html` don't exist yet, create that folder and save the template below as `report_template.html` and the code as `render.py`. Install with `pip install jinja2 weasyprint` (in a venv if pip is "externally managed"). Then run `python render.py audit.json` from that folder to write `report.html` (dark mode) and `report.pdf` (light print theme, page numbers, repeated table headers, a page break before the itemized bill). If weasyprint fails, it falls back to headless Chrome or Chromium. To check the layout: `pdftoppm -r 80 -png report.pdf prev` and `google-chrome --headless=new --no-sandbox --window-size=1280,4000 --screenshot=prev_html.png file://$PWD/report.html`. Look at both and fix any overflow before sending.

## Audit JSON (minimum)
```json
{"example": false, "example_notice": "",
 "meta": {"patient":"","provider":"","account":"","insurer":"","plan_terms":"","statement_date":"","dos_range":"","audit_date":""},
 "lines": [{"id":1,"visit":"A","date":"","rev":"","code":"","mod":"","description":"","units":1,"charge":0,"flag":"red|amber|purple|blue|green","kb_id":""}],
 "eob": [{"claim":"","visit":"A","dos":"","billed":0,"allowed":0,"plan_paid":0,"patient_resp":0,"notes":""}],
 "statement": {"date":"","amount_due":0,"items":[{"visit":"A","description":"","amount":0}]},
 "findings": [{"id":"F1","flag":"red","kb_id":"DB-1","lines":[11],"title":"","issue":"","evidence":"","rule_cite":"","rule_url":"","rule_date":"","charge_at_issue":0,"patient_savings_est":0,"status":"draft"}],
 "disputes": [{"n":1,"to":"","findings":["F1"],"channel":"","status":"draft","updated":""}]}
```
Statement items match EOB claims by `visit`; an item with a `visit` that matches no claim (e.g. "-") counts as "not tied to any claim." Set `patient_savings_est` to null for TBD. Don't count the same dollars in two findings.

## report_template.html
```html
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Bill audit: {{ m.provider }}</title><style>
:root{--bg:#0d1117;--p:#161b22;--p2:#1c2330;--ink:#e6edf3;--mu:#8b949e;--ln:#30363d;
--red:#ff6b6b;--red-bg:#3b1416;--amber:#f0b429;--amber-bg:#3a2b06;--purple:#c39bff;--purple-bg:#2b1c4a;--blue:#5aa9ff;--blue-bg:#0d2648;--green:#46c768;--green-bg:#0f2e19}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.5 "DejaVu Sans",system-ui,sans-serif}
.w{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 22px}h1{font-size:24px;margin:0}h2{font-size:17px;margin:28px 0 10px;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ln)}
.mu{color:var(--mu)}.sm{font-size:12px}.ex{background:var(--amber-bg);color:var(--amber);border:1px solid var(--amber);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px}
.box{background:var(--p2);border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-top:12px}
.kp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:14px}.k{background:var(--p);border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:10px;padding:10px}
.k .l{font-size:11px;color:var(--mu);text-transform:uppercase}.k .v{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
.c{display:inline-block;padding:1px 9px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid;white-space:nowrap}
{% for f in FO %}.c.{{f}}{color:var(--{{f}});background:var(--{{f}}-bg);border-color:var(--{{f}})}tr.{{f}} td:first-child{box-shadow:inset 4px 0 0 var(--{{f}})}.t-{{f}}{color:var(--{{f}})}{% endfor %}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:var(--p);border:1px solid var(--ln);font-size:13px}table.fx{table-layout:fixed}thead{display:table-header-group}
th,td{padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ln);vertical-align:top;text-align:left}th{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mu);background:var(--p2)}
tr{break-inside:avoid}tr.tot td{font-weight:700;background:var(--p2)}.n{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}th.n{white-space:normal}.nw{white-space:nowrap}
.kb{font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--purple)}.ev{color:var(--mu);font-size:12px}a{color:var(--blue);word-break:break-word}.pb{break-before:page}
@page{size:Letter;margin:14mm 12mm 16mm;@bottom-left{content:"Medical bill audit";font:8pt sans-serif;color:#666}@bottom-right{content:"Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:8pt sans-serif;color:#666}}
@media print{:root{--bg:#fff;--p:#fff;--p2:#f3f4f6;--ink:#111;--mu:#555;--ln:#d0d7de;--red:#c62828;--red-bg:#fdecea;--amber:#9a6700;--amber-bg:#fff4d6;--purple:#6f3fd1;--purple-bg:#f1eafe;--blue:#0b5cc4;--blue-bg:#e7f0fd;--green:#1a7f37;--green-bg:#e6f4ea}
html,body{font-size:9.5pt}.w{max-width:none;padding:0}h2{font-size:12pt;break-after:avoid}.kp{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px}.k .v{font-size:13pt}
table{font-size:8.5pt}th{font-size:7pt}th,td{padding:4px 5px}.c{font-size:6.5pt;padding:0 5px}a{text-decoration:none}}
</style></head><body><div class="w">
{% if d.example %}<div class="ex">{{ d.example_notice }}</div>{% endif %}
<h1>Medical bill audit: {{ m.provider }}</h1>
<div class="mu">{{ m.patient }} · Acct {{ m.account }} · {{ m.insurer }} · Statement {{ m.statement_date }} · DOS {{ m.dos_range }} · Audited {{ m.audit_date }}</div>
<div class="kp">{% for l,v,c in [("Total charges",k.total,""),("Statement: you owe",k.due,""),("EOB: you owe",k.eobp,""),("Billed above EOB",k.over,"red"),("Junk-fee charges",k.junk,"purple"),("Potential savings (est.)",k.sav,"green")] %}
<div class="k"><div class="l">{{l}}</div><div class="v t-{{c}}">{{ v|money }}</div></div>{% endfor %}</div>
<div class="box"><b>Summary:</b> {{ fs|length }} findings ({% for f in FO if k.cnt[f] %}{{ k.cnt[f] }} {{ f }}{{ ", " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}). Estimated corrected balance <b>{{ k.corr|money }}</b>, down from {{ k.due|money }}.<div class="sm mu">{{ m.plan_terms }}</div></div>
<h2>Flag legend</h2>{% for f in FO %}<span class="c {{f}}">{{ f|upper }} · {{ FL[f] }}</span> {% endfor %}
<h2>Findings</h2><table class="fx"><colgroup><col style="width:10%"><col style="width:7%"><col style="width:40%"><col style="width:18%"><col style="width:8%"><col style="width:8%"><col style="width:9%"></colgroup>
<thead><tr><th>Flag</th><th>Lines</th><th>Finding &amp; evidence</th><th>Rule (KB · source · date)</th><th class="n">At issue</th><th class="n">Est. savings</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for f in fs %}<tr class="{{f.flag}}"><td><span class="c {{f.flag}}">{{ f.flag|upper }}</span><div class="sm mu">{{f.id}}</div></td><td>{{ f.lines|join(", ") or "–" }}</td>
<td><b>{{f.title}}</b><br>{{f.issue}}<div class="ev">Evidence: {{f.evidence}}</div></td>
<td><span class="kb">{{f.kb_id}}</span><br>{% if f.rule_url %}<a href="{{f.rule_url}}">{{f.rule_cite}}</a>{% else %}{{f.rule_cite}}{% endif %}<div class="sm mu">{{f.rule_date}}</div></td>
<td class="n">{{ f.charge_at_issue|money if f.charge_at_issue else "–" }}</td><td class="n">{{ f.patient_savings_est|money if f.patient_savings_est is not none else "TBD" }}</td><td>{{f.status}}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
<tr class="tot"><td colspan="5">Total estimated patient savings (estimate)</td><td class="n">{{ k.sav|money }}</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2 class="pb">Itemized bill</h2><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Date</th><th>Rev</th><th>Code</th><th>Description</th><th class="n">Units</th><th class="n">Charge</th><th>Flag</th><th>KB</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for l in d.lines %}<tr class="{{l.flag}}"><td>{{l.id}}</td><td class="nw">{{l.date}}</td><td>{{l.rev or "–"}}</td><td>{{l.code or "–"}}{{ "-"~l.mod if l.mod }}</td><td>{{l.description}}</td><td class="n">{{l.units}}</td><td class="n">{{l.charge|money}}</td><td><span class="c {{l.flag}}">{{l.flag|upper}}</span></td><td class="kb">{{l.kb_id}}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
<tr class="tot"><td colspan="6">Total charges</td><td class="n">{{k.total|money}}</td><td colspan="2"></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>EOB reconciliation</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Claim</th><th>DOS</th><th class="n">Billed</th><th class="n">Allowed</th><th class="n">Plan paid</th><th class="n">EOB: you owe</th><th class="n">Statement</th><th class="n">Difference</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for e in eob %}<tr class="{{ 'red' if e.diff>0.005 else 'green' }}"><td class="nw">{{e.claim}}</td><td class="nw">{{e.dos}}</td>{% for x in [e.billed,e.allowed,e.plan_paid,e.patient_resp,e.stmt] %}<td class="n">{{x|money}}</td>{% endfor %}<td class="n t-{{ 'red' if e.diff>0.005 }}">{{e.diff|money}}</td></tr>
{% if e.notes %}<tr><td colspan="8" class="sm mu">{{e.notes}}</td></tr>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% if k.loose %}<tr class="red"><td colspan="6">Statement items not tied to any claim</td><td class="n">{{k.loose|money}}</td><td class="n t-red">{{k.loose|money}}</td></tr>{% endif %}
<tr class="tot"><td colspan="5">Total</td><td class="n">{{k.eobp|money}}</td><td class="n">{{k.due|money}}</td><td class="n">{{k.over|money}}</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Junk fees (purple)</h2><table><thead><tr><th>KB</th><th>Fee</th><th>Lines</th><th class="n">Charge</th><th class="n">Est. savings</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for f in fs if f.flag=="purple" %}<tr class="purple"><td class="kb">{{f.kb_id}}</td><td>{{f.title}}</td><td>{{f.lines|join(", ")}}</td><td class="n">{{f.charge_at_issue|money}}</td><td class="n">{{ f.patient_savings_est|money if f.patient_savings_est is not none else "TBD" }}</td></tr>{% else %}<tr><td colspan="5" class="mu">None found.</td></tr>{% endfor %}
<tr class="tot"><td colspan="3">Total junk-fee charges</td><td class="n">{{k.junk|money}}</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Dispute queue</h2><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>To</th><th>Findings</th><th>Channel</th><th>Status</th><th>Updated</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{% for q in d.disputes %}<tr><td>{{q.n}}</td><td>{{q.to}}</td><td>{{q.findings|join(", ")}}</td><td>{{q.channel}}</td><td>{{q.status}}</td><td>{{q.updated}}</td></tr>{% else %}<tr><td colspan="6" class="mu">None yet.</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
<h2>Sources cited</h2><ol class="sm">{% for s in src %}<li><a href="{{s.rule_url}}">{{s.rule_cite}}</a> ({{s.rule_date}})</li>{% endfor %}</ol>
<p class="sm mu" style="border-top:1px solid var(--ln);padding-top:8px">Not legal or medical advice. Medicare rules (CMS, NCCI, OIG) are the correct-coding benchmark; commercial and self-pay terms may differ, and state-law items vary by state. Savings are estimates until confirmed. No message is sent without your approval.</p>
</div></body></html>
```

## render.py
```python
import json, sys, shutil, subprocess, tempfile
from pathlib import Path
from jinja2 import Environment, FileSystemLoader, select_autoescape
FO = ["red", "amber", "purple", "blue", "green"]
FL = dict(red="likely error", amber="needs justification", purple="junk fee", blue="savings tactic", green="verified")
money = lambda v: "–" if v is None else ("-" if v < 0 else "") + f"${abs(v):,.2f}"

def context(d):
    fs = sorted(d["findings"], key=lambda f: (FO.index(f["flag"]), f["id"]))
    items, eob = d["statement"]["items"], []
    for e in d["eob"]:
        st = round(sum(i["amount"] for i in items if i["visit"] == e["visit"]), 2)
        eob.append({**e, "stmt": st, "diff": round(st - e["patient_resp"], 2)})
    vis = {e["visit"] for e in eob}
    due = d["statement"]["amount_due"]; eobp = round(sum(e["patient_resp"] for e in eob), 2)
    sav = round(sum(f.get("patient_savings_est") or 0 for f in fs), 2)
    k = dict(total=sum(l["charge"] for l in d["lines"]), due=due, eobp=eobp, over=round(due - eobp, 2),
             junk=sum(f.get("charge_at_issue") or 0 for f in fs if f["flag"] == "purple"), sav=sav,
             corr=max(round(due - sav, 2), 0), cnt={x: sum(f["flag"] == x for f in fs) for x in FO},
             loose=round(sum(i["amount"] for i in items if i["visit"] not in vis), 2))
    src = list({f["rule_url"]: f for f in fs if f.get("rule_url")}.values())
    return dict(d=d, m=d["meta"], k=k, fs=fs, eob=eob, src=src, FO=FO, FL=FL)

def main(audit, html="report.html", pdf="report.pdf", tpl="report_template.html"):
    env = Environment(loader=FileSystemLoader("."), autoescape=select_autoescape(["html"]))
    env.filters["money"] = money
    Path(html).write_text(env.get_template(tpl).render(**context(json.load(open(audit)))))
    try:
        from weasyprint import HTML; HTML(filename=html).write_pdf(pdf)   # uses @media print + @page
    except Exception:
        chrome = next(filter(None, map(shutil.which, ["chromium", "chromium-browser", "google-chrome"])))
        with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as p:
            subprocess.run([chrome, "--headless=new", "--no-sandbox", f"--user-data-dir={p}", "--no-pdf-header-footer",
                            f"--print-to-pdf={pdf}", Path(html).resolve().as_uri()], check=True)
    print("wrote", html, pdf)

if __name__ == "__main__":
    main(*sys.argv[1:])
```
Flag rules: red = likely error · amber = needs justification · purple = junk fee (validly coded but disputable on notice, state-law, or reasonableness grounds) · blue = savings tactic · green = verified. Every finding needs a KB ID, a rule, a URL, and a date. Label estimates. Send the HTML and PDF to the user as attachments with a one-line summary.
